Subject: [DIAGNOSTIC] qti_glink_charger: validate replies and expose raw read-only ADC

Base: eqs-development/android_kernel_motorola_sm8475-modules
Commit: 9f8d247d457622c08ff547e5498e6fa453e876ed

eqs RETAR replies leave the property field at zero; it cannot correlate reads.
Serialize queries and latch ADC off after any failed read, including normal
charger reads: a late battery reply also has 40 bytes. Normal policy continues.
No power-role, voltage, reset or firmware-update commands are added.

--- a/motorola/drivers/power/qti_glink_charger/qti_glink_charger.c
